  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Maternal &amp; Child Health in Balochistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our project aims to tackle the high maternal and child mortality rates in Balochistan through a comprehensive approach. By strengthening healthcare services, improving access to care, enhancing nutrition, and raising awareness, we aim to reduce maternal mortality from 300 to 200 per 100,000 live births and child mortality from 86 to 60 per 1,000 live births. Through the establishment of health centers, mobile clinics, nutrition programs and community engagement to save lives in Balochistan</narrative>
  </description>
